          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7g6",
          "text": "Suffering a serious injury in an accident can derail your life. You may be faced with great uncertainty about your future as the victim of a harmful car crash, slip, and fall, or another type of accident in Thornton, Colorado. At Dormer Harpring, LLC, a Thornton personal injury attorney can help you pick up the pieces and put your life back together after an accident. We are passionate about holding wrongdoers accountable and helping our clients recover physically, emotionally, and financially. Find out how we can help you with a personal injury claim today.",
