    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7h3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7h2",
          "text": "A personal injury lawsuit is a chance for an injured accident victim to hold a wrongdoer accountable and recover fair financial compensation for their losses. A lawsuit can make you and your family whole again after a serious accident by reimbursing you for related expenses and restoring you to the financial position that you were in before the accident took place. A lawsuit can also shed light on negligent actions or careless parties in your community, forcing them to take responsibility for their actions and make safety changes to prevent further such accidents in the future.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7h5",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7h4",
          "text": "Why Should I Hire a Thornton Personal Injury Lawyer?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7h7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7h6",
          "text": "You may feel like you are alone after being injured in an accident in Colorado. The other party may try to refute fault or blame you for the accident. Insurance companies may try to take advantage of you to minimize your financial recovery. If you hire a personal injury attorney, however, you will have an advocate in your corner.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7h9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7h8",
          "text": "Your Thornton personal injury lawyer will work for you and be vigilant about protecting your best interests. You can trust that your attorney will take steps to protect your rights and maximize your financial recovery. An attorney can handle important legal tasks for you while you are healing from your serious injuries, including:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
