          "text": "As your attorneys, we will begin your personal injury claim with a comprehensive overview of what happened and who might be to blame. Then, we will conduct a deeper investigation of your accident to collect any available evidence of fault. We will be there to guide you and your family through each step of a claim. Your experienced Thornton personal injury lawyer will make sure that you have everything you need.",
